# ---- Gradle ----
.gradle/
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
# gradle-wrapper.jar is intentionally NOT ignored. It isn't in this repo yet; if you
# generate it (locally or from the CI reports artifact), committing it is correct and
# is what every Android project does.

# ---- Android / local machine ----
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
output.json
release/

# ---- Signing material: never commit these ----
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
keystore.properties
signing.properties
# This repository is PUBLIC. Its history is permanent and cannot be scrubbed by deleting a file
# in a later commit — a committed key is a leaked key from the moment it is pushed, and the only
# real remedy is revoking and reissuing it. Release signing material must never be added here,
# not even briefly, not even in a branch. Use Play App Signing, or keep the keystore off this
# machine's repository entirely and pass it to CI as an encrypted secret.

# ---- Android Studio / IntelliJ ----
*.iml
.idea/*
!.idea/codeStyles/
!.idea/inspectionProfiles/
*.hprof

# ---- macOS / editors ----
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/

# ---- Misc ----
*.log
!.github/**
__pycache__/

# Editor backups. The agent sandbox cannot delete files in this tree,
# so a stray *.bak must at least never reach a commit.
*.bak

# Code review write-ups, kept locally to read. `push.sh` does `git add -A`, so anything left in
# the working tree gets committed by default — these are working notes about a branch, not part
# of the project's own documentation, and they go stale the moment the branch is fixed.
REVIEW_*.md

# ---- Map extracts ----
# Region files are cut with `pmtiles extract` (REGION_FILES.md) and distributed as GitHub
# release assets, never as repo contents. They are hundreds of megabytes; GitHub hard-rejects
# any file over 100 MB on push, and git history is forever even when the push fails.
#
# This line exists because both extracts were once produced in the repo root, where `push.sh`
# does `git add -A` and would have staged 347 MB without comment.
*.pmtiles
*.pmtiles.part
*.mbtiles
